WEBVTT

00:10.350 --> 00:13.070
Keep it up, Miri!

00:16.790 --> 00:18.400
Goal!

00:18.980 --> 00:21.230
Awesome work, Miri! It's a new record!

00:23.270 --> 00:25.470
Hooray!

00:25.890 --> 00:29.710
You'll win that field day race for sure.

00:29.710 --> 00:30.530
Yeah!

00:31.000 --> 00:31.970
Well done.

00:31.970 --> 00:34.750
C'mon, man, show a little more enthusiasm!

00:34.750 --> 00:38.410
You saw how hard Miri was practicing, right?

00:38.410 --> 00:40.150
It's not like I'm the one running.

00:40.150 --> 00:41.010
Have a heart!

00:41.010 --> 00:46.170
It's our job to advise her and 
get excited on her behalf.

00:48.680 --> 00:51.920
Swift running requires efficient 
training of the musculi trunci

00:51.920 --> 00:53.500
of the hip joint and of the hamstrings.

00:53.500 --> 00:54.050
Ham...?

00:54.050 --> 00:57.390
The posterior muscle groups beginning with 
the femorals can be amplified with squats—

00:57.390 --> 00:58.800
Yeah, forget it.

00:59.190 --> 01:01.220
I wanna practice more!

01:01.220 --> 01:03.570
You sure you're not overdoing it?

01:04.140 --> 01:06.990
I gotta get that gold medal!

01:07.940 --> 01:10.300
That's the spirit, Miri!

01:10.690 --> 01:12.960
C'mon, cheer her on with me!

01:14.960 --> 01:17.100
I'm starting now, Papa!

01:17.100 --> 01:20.000
Okay, on your mark!

01:20.000 --> 01:21.500
Get set!

01:21.870 --> 01:22.940
Start!

01:24.930 --> 01:26.690
<b>Yadorigi
Coffee • Light Meals</b>

01:27.100 --> 01:28.570
Field day?

01:28.570 --> 01:30.430
It's this Sunday.

01:30.430 --> 01:33.880
We were practicing for the race together.

01:33.880 --> 01:36.190
I ran <i>so</i> much!

01:36.500 --> 01:39.990
You've got grit, just like me!

01:39.990 --> 01:41.500
Just like <i>who</i>?

01:41.500 --> 01:42.520
Like <i>me</i>!

01:43.460 --> 01:45.980
Quit glaring at me like that.

01:45.980 --> 01:49.940
Never thought I'd see you two 
going along with a kids' event.

01:49.940 --> 01:52.080
Come watch her, Kyu-chan!

01:52.080 --> 01:54.330
I'm afraid I can't.

01:54.330 --> 01:57.910
Papas can take lots of pictures, then!

01:57.910 --> 02:00.080
I want Kyu-chan to see!

02:00.080 --> 02:01.960
Yeah, smart thinking!

02:01.960 --> 02:02.950
How many should we take?

02:02.950 --> 02:04.470
Um...

02:04.470 --> 02:05.150
A hundred!

02:05.150 --> 02:05.970
So many!

02:06.350 --> 02:09.900
<i>Hey, I want to love, is this true love?</i>

02:09.900 --> 02:13.520
<i>Is just wanting to be loved insincere?</i>

02:13.520 --> 02:15.780
<i>What should I do?</i>

02:15.780 --> 02:18.150
<i>Oh, what should I do?</i>

02:21.450 --> 02:24.450
<i>As usual, the whole city</i>

02:24.450 --> 02:28.120
<i>Is madly in love and excited</i>

02:28.120 --> 02:31.670
<i>Extras like me just go home</i>

02:31.670 --> 02:34.960
<i>But I'm not sulking at all</i>

02:34.960 --> 02:38.800
<i>"And then you appeared suddenly</i>

02:38.800 --> 02:42.340
<i>As though you were ripping 
through those days</i>

02:42.340 --> 02:45.930
<i>With your smile that leaves me numb</i>

02:45.930 --> 02:50.270
<i>You shattered my heart</i>

02:51.440 --> 02:55.020
<i>Hey, I want to love, is this true love?</i>

02:55.020 --> 02:58.650
<i>Is just wanting to be loved insincere?</i>

02:58.650 --> 03:00.820
<i>What should I do?</i>

03:00.820 --> 03:03.160
<i>Oh, what should I do?</i>

03:03.450 --> 03:05.530
<i>How the heck should I know?</i>

03:05.530 --> 03:09.370
<i>I don't know what's going on in your head</i>

03:09.370 --> 03:13.040
<i>But it's not fair that you're so friendly</i>

03:13.040 --> 03:17.760
<i>Once again, I'm being 
swallowed up by your rhythm</i>

03:19.920 --> 03:24.600
<i>There you go, you've got me 
wrapped around your finger again</i>

03:30.890 --> 03:35.770
<i>There you go, you've got me 
wrapped around your finger again</i>

03:52.000 --> 03:52.750
<b>Aozora Daycare</b>

04:16.610 --> 04:18.860
<b>Miri's Field Day</b>

04:19.030 --> 04:19.990
I'm back.

04:19.990 --> 04:22.230
Hey, back alrea—

04:22.430 --> 04:24.310
The hell happened to your face?!

04:24.310 --> 04:25.990
The mission went flawlessly.

04:25.990 --> 04:27.790
We'll see about that!

04:27.790 --> 04:30.930
The other moms told me the fight over 
spots can get pretty cutthroat.

04:30.930 --> 04:32.260
I've done what's necessary.

04:32.260 --> 04:34.250
Amateurs will be kept away.

04:34.700 --> 04:36.870
What the hell did he do?

04:37.330 --> 04:39.070
Uh-oh, better hurry!

04:40.950 --> 04:42.590
Can I help?

04:45.400 --> 04:47.660
I mean, I can make rice balls—

04:47.660 --> 04:49.040
No fever, huh?

04:49.040 --> 04:50.900
What's wrong, Rei? Have you finally snapped?

04:50.900 --> 04:52.960
Did you get food poisoning somewhere?!

04:52.960 --> 04:54.150
I feel pretty normal.

04:58.720 --> 05:03.350
Oh, to think this day would come!

05:03.730 --> 05:04.980
Calm down.

05:04.980 --> 05:08.740
It used to be you couldn't even 
make cup ramen for yourself.

05:09.160 --> 05:12.520
But now, to help Miri...

05:13.090 --> 05:15.040
You think Miri will like it?

05:15.040 --> 05:16.590
Damn right she will!

05:16.590 --> 05:18.870
"Papa Rei made them!"

05:18.870 --> 05:20.670
She'll be over the moon, man!

05:21.330 --> 05:24.300
What do you do at a field day?

05:26.290 --> 05:27.630
I've never been to one.

05:27.630 --> 05:29.920
Oh, that?

05:29.920 --> 05:32.870
I've never really been either, so I dunno.

05:32.870 --> 05:36.060
I guess we watch the kids 
run around, take pictures,

05:36.060 --> 05:37.910
and cheer 'em on as loud as we can?

05:37.910 --> 05:39.290
That probably covers it.

05:39.650 --> 05:41.080
As loud as we can...

05:41.810 --> 05:43.660
Morning!

05:44.570 --> 05:46.300
It all looks tasty!

05:46.300 --> 05:49.580
Yeah, I made all your faves!

05:49.580 --> 05:52.080
You can bank on this being one great lunch!

05:53.670 --> 05:57.570
And if you can believe it, 
Rei's making rice balls!

05:57.570 --> 06:00.130
Papa Rei's rice balls?!

06:00.130 --> 06:02.570
We'll get you running on all cylinders!

06:02.570 --> 06:04.330
You'll win a gold medal for sure!

06:04.330 --> 06:06.480
Hooray!

06:07.840 --> 06:11.350
<b>Aozora Daycare</b>

06:07.840 --> 06:11.350
<b>Field Day</b>

06:08.040 --> 06:10.200
Morning, Teacher.

06:10.200 --> 06:11.840
Yes, good morning!

06:11.840 --> 06:13.420
Good morning!

06:14.580 --> 06:15.980
All right, Miri.

06:15.980 --> 06:19.460
We're heading off to watch
you from the sidelines, okay?

06:19.460 --> 06:20.340
Okay!

06:21.190 --> 06:22.380
Good morning!

06:22.380 --> 06:24.050
Morning, Miri-chan!

06:24.050 --> 06:25.840
Are you excited too?

06:25.840 --> 06:27.700
I don't wanna race.

06:27.700 --> 06:29.190
We'll all race hard together!

06:30.690 --> 06:33.040
Okay, let's make our move.

06:36.840 --> 06:39.140
Where's the spot you grabbed us?

06:39.140 --> 06:40.190
Over there.

06:45.010 --> 06:47.320
My measures seem to have proved effective.

06:47.320 --> 06:51.390
They probably thought some 
crazy person set that up.

06:52.230 --> 06:54.520
Okay, I got a great shot...

06:54.520 --> 06:57.440
Incredible. There are so many cameras...

06:57.440 --> 06:58.640
But can they beat this?!

07:03.240 --> 07:05.670
Well? We take first prize, right?

07:05.670 --> 07:07.020
In <i>what</i>, exactly?

07:07.020 --> 07:09.170
Morning, Papa Kazuki!

07:09.170 --> 07:10.900
Oh, good morning!

07:10.900 --> 07:12.710
Morning, all!

07:12.710 --> 07:14.700
Goodness, you brought so much!

07:14.700 --> 07:18.240
Papa Kazuki, did you make 
an amazing lunch today?

07:18.240 --> 07:19.520
Was it that obvious?

07:19.520 --> 07:21.830
I've been all-in since this morning!

07:21.830 --> 07:24.020
Aren't you grateful for 
the wonderful weather?

07:24.020 --> 07:28.370
My little Kotori made ten 
rain charms yesterday!

07:28.370 --> 07:30.210
Oh, how darling!

07:30.220 --> 07:31.710
You really are at home with the moms.

07:32.030 --> 07:35.750
We drop our kids off every day, 
so we get to know each other!

07:35.750 --> 07:36.850
Wanna know something cool?

07:36.850 --> 07:39.800
They say all the moms 
crush on the two of us.

07:39.800 --> 07:43.120
That's right! You're very 
popular as well, Papa Rei.

07:43.120 --> 07:46.300
That's right! "Don't you love a 
man with a dark side?" they say.

07:46.300 --> 07:51.060
"He's got that cool hitman look!" 
"So mysterious!" they say.

07:51.250 --> 07:54.050
Wh-What a funny thing to say, right, Rei?

07:54.050 --> 07:57.780
But I heard Papa Rei was 
actually a comedian! Right?

07:57.780 --> 07:58.890
No, no!

07:58.890 --> 08:01.870
Papa Kazuki is the comedian, 
and Papa Rei is the oil baron.

08:01.870 --> 08:03.340
W-Well who gives a damn?!

08:03.340 --> 08:04.410
So fast with a quip!

08:04.410 --> 08:05.590
Just like a comedian!

08:05.590 --> 08:06.650
Knock off that talk!

08:06.650 --> 08:07.590
So cool!

08:07.980 --> 08:10.820
Item one on our program: 
the opening ceremony!

08:10.820 --> 08:15.750
Our energetic students will hold 
a procession onto the field!

08:16.590 --> 08:18.620
Hey, here she comes!

08:18.620 --> 08:21.030
We'll start with the junior class!

08:21.020 --> 08:24.020
<b>Aozora Daycare</b>

08:21.030 --> 08:24.010
One, two! One, two!

08:24.010 --> 08:25.720
Show us that energy!

08:28.270 --> 08:30.500
I gotta get in there!

08:30.940 --> 08:33.240
Now the senior classes!

08:34.140 --> 08:36.320
Miri! Look here!

08:36.990 --> 08:39.820
The double peace sign! 
Great choice, Miri-chan!

08:40.260 --> 08:42.650
Awesome! Lookin' great!

08:42.650 --> 08:44.280
Love it!

08:43.080 --> 08:45.480
Papa Kazuki's something else.

08:45.480 --> 08:47.590
He's so stricken with Miri-chan!

08:48.750 --> 08:50.580
Is that how we're supposed to act?

08:51.210 --> 08:56.470
<b>Aozora Daycare</b>

08:52.010 --> 08:56.480
We will now commence the 
Aozora Daycare Field Day.

08:56.730 --> 08:59.270
Daycare representative, Unasaka Miri-chan.

08:59.270 --> 09:02.060
Would you come up here and 
deliver the greeting?

09:02.060 --> 09:03.940
Good luck, Miri-chan!

09:03.940 --> 09:04.830
Thanks!

09:07.940 --> 09:18.200
<b>Aid</b>

09:07.940 --> 09:18.200
<b>Announcer</b>

09:09.380 --> 09:10.310
Here you are.

09:12.660 --> 09:18.210
We did a lot of training for this field day!

09:18.620 --> 09:21.400
We will do our best today,

09:21.400 --> 09:24.960
so dads and moms and teachers and everyone,

09:24.960 --> 09:26.610
please cheer for us!

09:27.070 --> 09:28.780
Bravo!

09:29.660 --> 09:32.040
Keep it down, please, sir.

09:32.040 --> 09:33.920
S-Sorry!

09:36.040 --> 09:39.300
Item two on our program: 
the dancing ball shoot.

09:39.300 --> 09:41.850
Dancing ball shoot?

09:41.850 --> 09:43.300
The heck is that?

09:54.570 --> 09:55.810
One more!

09:55.810 --> 09:57.870
Hina! You look so cute!

09:57.870 --> 10:00.060
Kotori! Give 'em hell!

10:00.060 --> 10:03.720
Miri! Go hard!

10:06.080 --> 10:10.380
Item four on our program: 
the teacher-and-child tug-of-war!

10:13.210 --> 10:16.960
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

10:13.210 --> 10:16.970
<b>Aozora Daycare</b>

10:16.960 --> 10:18.620
Heave-ho!

10:18.620 --> 10:20.480
We're winning this!

10:20.480 --> 10:21.980
Yeah!

10:21.980 --> 10:24.490
Pull!

10:26.930 --> 10:30.100
<b>Aozora Daycare</b>

10:30.360 --> 10:32.290
Anna-chan's really something.

10:32.290 --> 10:34.530
Might makes right.

10:34.530 --> 10:36.540
You're so strong, Teacher!

10:36.540 --> 10:38.740
Miss Anna, you're awesome!

10:40.780 --> 10:45.160
Item six on our program: 
Giraffe Class gymnastic formations!

10:46.910 --> 10:48.870
So cute!

10:48.870 --> 10:51.080
Nice bulk! Perfectly done!

10:51.080 --> 10:53.590
Miri, you rock!

10:55.730 --> 10:57.510
Looking... good...

10:59.090 --> 11:01.020
Hey! Too close!

11:01.020 --> 11:03.120
Hands to yourself, you little bastard!

11:03.120 --> 11:04.200
He dies.

11:05.010 --> 11:06.260
He dies.

11:06.650 --> 11:09.770
Um... it's a lot less funny when you say it.

11:10.550 --> 11:13.030
It's time for lunch break now.

11:13.370 --> 11:16.450
Please eat your delicious lunches

11:16.450 --> 11:19.280
and build up our energy for the afternoon!

11:21.750 --> 11:24.190
It's like a party!

11:24.190 --> 11:26.280
Looks so good!

11:26.280 --> 11:27.970
We've got dessert too!

11:27.970 --> 11:30.430
No way! What a feast!

11:30.430 --> 11:32.800
Papa Kazuki, you made all of this yourself?

11:32.800 --> 11:34.180
Well, pretty much!

11:34.400 --> 11:36.330
You're so lucky, Miri-chan!

11:36.330 --> 11:37.930
I want some too!

11:37.930 --> 11:41.600
There's plenty to go around! 
Help yourselves, girls!

11:41.600 --> 11:43.610
Let's eat together, then!

11:43.610 --> 11:45.530
Oh, how delightful!

11:45.530 --> 11:46.830
Mama?

11:46.830 --> 11:49.070
Well, I can't turn down that offer!

11:49.350 --> 11:51.080
Such good fried chicken!

11:51.080 --> 11:52.940
It really is! I could eat it all!

11:51.650 --> 11:54.520
I recommend Hashimoto Hospital
 on the weekends.

11:54.520 --> 11:56.490
Oh? I'll check it out soon!

11:56.100 --> 11:58.860
It's so good! Eat this one too!

11:56.490 --> 11:57.890
Oh, they don't just do internal medicine?

11:57.890 --> 11:58.850
No, they do it all!

11:59.640 --> 12:01.360
Maybe I shouldn't...

12:01.810 --> 12:04.130
Hey! Papa Rei's rice balls!

12:04.130 --> 12:05.560
I wanna try them!

12:10.870 --> 12:12.740
It's Choco Rings!

12:12.740 --> 12:14.840
I wanna try too!

12:13.720 --> 12:15.250
Well, she likes them...

12:14.840 --> 12:15.880
Me too!

12:15.250 --> 12:17.500
I know, dude, but what the hell—

12:15.880 --> 12:17.070
They're good!

12:19.480 --> 12:21.340
It's strawberry jam!

12:21.340 --> 12:23.010
Mine's got gummies.

12:23.010 --> 12:25.840
Couldn't you make more responsible choices?

12:23.010 --> 12:25.840
Really? Cool!

12:25.840 --> 12:27.960
You did taste them first, right?!

12:28.380 --> 12:29.980
Yeah? They were good.

12:30.510 --> 12:35.100
I see cooking for you everyday 
hasn't improved your taste.

12:35.630 --> 12:38.290
It's all my favorites!

12:38.290 --> 12:39.610
I like it so much!

12:40.820 --> 12:41.600
See?

12:43.300 --> 12:45.480
Thanks, Papa Rei!

12:49.980 --> 12:53.400
We're about to start the afternoon program.

12:53.400 --> 12:57.870
We'd like to ask everyone taking part in 
the race to come to the entrance gate!

12:58.150 --> 13:01.190
All right, Miri! Time to show your stuff!

13:01.190 --> 13:02.050
Yeah!

13:02.050 --> 13:04.950
I'm totally, totally 
getting that gold medal,

13:04.950 --> 13:06.900
so you guys make sure to watch!

13:06.900 --> 13:08.800
I know how hard you've been working!

13:08.800 --> 13:10.190
Give it your best shot!

13:10.190 --> 13:11.660
I know!

13:12.660 --> 13:15.150
Fight hard, Miri!

13:16.770 --> 13:18.580
Go for it!

13:18.580 --> 13:20.020
Don't trip!

13:20.330 --> 13:22.110
On your marks...

13:23.280 --> 13:25.530
<b>Aozora Daycare</b>

13:25.520 --> 13:26.760
Go for it!

13:26.760 --> 13:28.270
Take care!

13:27.030 --> 13:28.270
So fast!

13:30.530 --> 13:31.960
Keep going!

13:37.290 --> 13:40.800
Okay! Next group!

13:44.480 --> 13:46.650
She's really nervous.

13:46.650 --> 13:49.010
Miri! Just treat it like practice!

13:49.010 --> 13:51.130
Relax! Relax!

13:54.820 --> 13:58.230
She's getting me nervous, too!

13:58.230 --> 14:00.090
Hope it works out.

14:00.880 --> 14:02.630
On your marks!

14:07.810 --> 14:09.610
Go, Miri!

14:09.610 --> 14:11.410
Full speed ahead!

14:12.280 --> 14:13.860
Keep it up! Yes!

14:15.660 --> 14:18.330
That's the way! Go!

14:20.840 --> 14:23.750
Go for it, Miri!

14:24.150 --> 14:26.070
Miri. Go for it.

14:31.090 --> 14:32.720
Go! Go!

14:31.890 --> 14:32.840
Go.

14:34.350 --> 14:35.400
Go!

14:37.220 --> 14:39.750
Go for it, Miri!

14:44.440 --> 14:45.240
Miri!

14:46.850 --> 14:48.490
Wait for me!

14:48.490 --> 14:50.630
Oh, heck.

14:52.000 --> 14:53.470
Keep it up!

14:57.790 --> 15:00.390
Great work, Miri-chan!

15:01.840 --> 15:03.310
You really did your best.

15:03.790 --> 15:04.740
Here.

15:04.740 --> 15:06.090
Great effort!

15:14.840 --> 15:16.820
Look, look! I got the gold!

15:16.820 --> 15:18.640
Nice work, Taiga!

15:18.640 --> 15:20.100
You rocked it out there!

15:20.900 --> 15:25.260
I wanted to give you guys a 
gold medal, but I messed up!

15:25.620 --> 15:27.550
I'm sorry...

15:27.550 --> 15:29.760
Don't be silly, dear.

15:29.760 --> 15:32.100
All we wanted was for you to try.

15:32.100 --> 15:33.610
Isn't that right, Rei?

15:34.500 --> 15:36.160
It's my fault.

15:37.440 --> 15:38.670
No, dude.

15:38.670 --> 15:40.800
What the heck? Why would you say that?

15:40.800 --> 15:45.200
For mothers and fathers who want to 
take part in the parent-child games,

15:42.630 --> 15:44.770
Hey, you okay?

15:44.770 --> 15:47.180
Oh, I wanna play!

15:45.200 --> 15:49.160
please come to the entrance 
gate with your child.

15:48.640 --> 15:51.670
C'mon, Papas! Let's all go!

15:51.670 --> 15:53.560
Sure, sure!

15:54.140 --> 15:55.930
You up, man?

15:56.520 --> 15:58.590
No, thanks...

15:59.070 --> 16:00.310
Okay, got it.

16:00.590 --> 16:02.700
Let's do it, then.

16:03.250 --> 16:05.260
Papa Rei, watch me!

16:05.260 --> 16:08.480
I'm getting that gold medal this time!

16:09.710 --> 16:12.490
Okay! Let's get this done!

16:12.490 --> 16:14.610
Yeah, let's get it!

16:15.930 --> 16:19.700
<i>Cheering is complicated.</i>

16:21.430 --> 16:24.650
The next program is the parent-child race.

16:24.650 --> 16:31.750
Let's all work really hard with our papas 
and mamas and grandpas and grandmas!

16:29.560 --> 16:33.120
Watch me, Papa Rei!

16:35.950 --> 16:38.920
Let's get our first parent-child 
pairs out there!

16:39.270 --> 16:41.890
Cheer them on, everyone!

16:48.830 --> 16:50.710
On your marks!

16:50.710 --> 16:52.110
Get set!

16:54.940 --> 16:58.880
They'll run into all kinds of 
obstacles along the course.

16:58.880 --> 17:02.060
Let's all work together to get past them!

17:03.580 --> 17:05.110
Oh, what a tough obstacle!

17:05.110 --> 17:07.270
There's a treat suspended in midair!

17:07.270 --> 17:09.910
Can the kids eat them while riding 
on their guardian's back?

17:10.190 --> 17:11.600
Miri, jump on!

17:16.020 --> 17:16.800
Huh?

17:16.800 --> 17:18.650
Kotori, hang in there!

17:20.190 --> 17:21.570
Little bastard!

17:21.860 --> 17:26.930
Next, our pairs have to run 
with a big pair of boxers on!

17:26.930 --> 17:30.060
One, two! One, two! One, two!

17:27.240 --> 17:29.500
Let's all be careful not to trip!

17:30.070 --> 17:33.450
Heck yeah, Taiga! Keep it up!

17:33.450 --> 17:38.250
One, two! One, two!

17:33.450 --> 17:38.250
One, two! One, two!

17:33.450 --> 17:38.250
One, two! One, two!

17:35.280 --> 17:38.250
Hurry! Hurry! Hurr—

17:38.540 --> 17:39.410
You okay?

17:39.410 --> 17:39.950
Miri-chan!

17:41.160 --> 17:42.570
Ow...

17:41.550 --> 17:43.290
I'm so sorry, Papa!

17:43.290 --> 17:45.790
Don't give up yet! We're still in this!

17:45.790 --> 17:46.410
Yeah!

17:47.580 --> 17:49.620
One, two! One, two!

17:50.460 --> 17:51.510
Go for it.

17:51.510 --> 17:54.340
Next up is the scavenger hunt!

17:54.340 --> 17:58.640
The box is full of cards with all 
kinds of things written on them.

17:58.640 --> 18:01.310
Once you find the item written on the card,

18:01.310 --> 18:03.220
take it to the finish line!

18:03.220 --> 18:04.450
Be careful!

18:04.450 --> 18:05.720
Go for it!

18:13.070 --> 18:14.620
What's it say?

18:15.810 --> 18:16.830
Miri?

18:21.050 --> 18:22.330
What?

18:22.760 --> 18:24.170
Where are you going?!

18:32.030 --> 18:34.470
Papa Rei, come with us!

18:35.720 --> 18:37.740
Hurry! Hurry!

18:37.740 --> 18:39.890
Come with us!

18:50.160 --> 18:52.440
Papas, run!

18:56.860 --> 18:57.730
Okay!

19:01.580 --> 19:02.950
Awesome!

19:02.950 --> 19:05.200
That oil baron is so hot!

19:07.960 --> 19:09.970
So fast! So fast!

19:12.180 --> 19:14.200
Goal!

19:15.030 --> 19:17.300
I did it!

19:17.970 --> 19:20.210
Heck yeah!

19:27.750 --> 19:29.980
The gold medal!

19:29.980 --> 19:31.810
You did it, Miri!

19:29.980 --> 19:33.480
<b>Field Day</b>

19:31.810 --> 19:33.480
Yeah! I'm so happy!

19:33.480 --> 19:35.300
You worked really hard, huh?

19:35.040 --> 19:36.390
Nice.

19:35.300 --> 19:36.070
Yeah!

19:36.980 --> 19:49.750
<b>Field Day</b>

19:37.410 --> 19:38.780
By the way, Miri.

19:38.780 --> 19:41.060
What'd it say on that card?

19:41.060 --> 19:42.650
Hey, yeah.

19:42.650 --> 19:44.470
Why'd you go for Rei?

19:44.470 --> 19:46.350
Well...

19:47.190 --> 19:48.110
See?

19:49.750 --> 19:51.750
<b>Family</b>

19:58.530 --> 19:59.990
Don't cry, man.

20:00.800 --> 20:01.600
I won't.

20:04.700 --> 20:06.190
Nice hypocrisy, man.

20:06.190 --> 20:10.770
B-But... it says... "f-family"...

20:11.960 --> 20:14.540
She thinks we're family! It says family!

20:12.330 --> 20:15.660
Papa's a grown-up who's crying!

20:14.540 --> 20:16.530
She thinks we're family!

20:15.020 --> 20:20.990
<b>Family</b>

20:15.660 --> 20:18.450
What a weird face!

20:21.300 --> 20:27.040
After a brief break, we'll hold the last 
event and then our closing ceremony.

20:27.250 --> 20:33.600
Guardians, keep cheering 
your kids on to the end.

20:34.780 --> 20:38.540
Let's all make sure to 
stay nice and hydrated!

20:40.060 --> 20:42.780
Miri-chan, congratulations on winning!

20:42.780 --> 20:46.160
Anna-chan, look! I won a gold medal!

20:46.160 --> 20:48.840
Yes, you looked very cool!

20:49.190 --> 20:54.430
Oh, would you all like a picture 
together to commemorate the occasion?

20:54.430 --> 20:56.030
I'd be happy to take it.

20:56.910 --> 20:58.100
Yeah!

20:58.970 --> 21:00.740
You okay to take a picture?

21:00.740 --> 21:03.420
Would it bad if a pic 
of us together got out?

21:03.420 --> 21:06.860
Yeah, we probably wanna 
avoid leaving evidence...

21:06.860 --> 21:09.500
Papas, hurry! Hurry!

21:09.840 --> 21:13.670
Get a picture with me and my gold medal!

21:14.210 --> 21:15.810
Can't argue with that.

21:16.270 --> 21:17.510
Just one, okay?

21:18.590 --> 21:21.800
Okay! Big smiles, all!

21:22.220 --> 21:24.090
What does the mouse eat?

21:24.090 --> 21:25.860
Cheese!

21:28.470 --> 21:32.430
This marks the end of our field day.

21:32.430 --> 21:35.220
Take care on your way home, all.

21:38.890 --> 21:40.800
Ow, ow, ow...

21:41.230 --> 21:45.030
Sorry, Rei. My back hurts.

21:45.030 --> 21:46.970
I probably got carried away.

21:46.970 --> 21:48.720
Act your age next time, old man.

21:50.630 --> 21:52.610
She's fast asleep.

21:52.610 --> 21:53.860
She worked hard.

21:53.860 --> 21:55.890
You worked hard, too.

21:55.890 --> 21:58.110
Cheering for her as loud as you could.

21:59.380 --> 22:03.210
Hope she can get that gold 
in the race next year.

22:06.610 --> 22:08.470
Let's get back to practicing.

22:08.470 --> 22:10.390
Yeah, we'll do that.

22:14.020 --> 22:19.060
<i>The scenery never changes and 
every day is full of surprises</i>

22:19.060 --> 22:23.530
<i>But those are the best parts</i>

22:23.530 --> 22:28.280
<i>Wrapped around your finger 
and going in circles</i>

22:28.530 --> 22:33.160
<i>These days are dizzying yet endearing</i>

22:33.370 --> 22:37.710
<i>On your restless nights, 
I softly whisper a lullaby</i>

22:37.710 --> 22:42.460
<i>And stroke your hair to the 
rhythm of your breathing</i>

22:42.920 --> 22:47.050
<i>I just want these days to 
continue as long as possible</i>

22:47.050 --> 22:52.050
<i>Even if it's just a day</i>

22:52.850 --> 22:57.770
<i>I chased after you as you ran barefoot</i>

22:57.770 --> 23:01.980
<i>Maybe one day, you'll surpass me, ah</i>

23:01.980 --> 23:06.650
<i>I wonder what tomorrow's going to be like</i>

23:06.650 --> 23:11.570
<i>Why don't we walk together?</i>

23:11.570 --> 23:16.330
<i>This will always be our place to come home to</i>

23:16.830 --> 23:21.130
<i>And it'll shine down on our sadness</i>

23:21.130 --> 23:25.800
<i>That's all right, yeah, that's okay</i>

23:25.800 --> 23:30.720
<i>Let's try to share our love together</i>

23:30.720 --> 23:34.140
<i>Let the light always shine upon hope</i>

23:34.140 --> 23:40.640
<i>When the future is unpredictable</i>

23:47.160 --> 23:49.630
Don't forget the job.
